Package: libslotsboxmalloc1
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends},libblockmalloc1
Description: 16-way buddy-style fixed-block allocator library
 A compact shared library implementing a 16-ary buddy allocator for
 allocating fixed/aligned objects. The runtime package contains the
 shared library(s) needed by programs.

Package: libslotsboxmalloc1-dev
Section: libdevel
Architecture: any
Depends: libslotsboxmalloc1 (= ${binary:Version}), libblockmalloc1-dev, ${misc:Depends}
Description: development files for libslotsboxmalloc1
 Header files and pkg-config metadata for developing against libslotsboxmalloc1.